            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly **^^Astra Militarum^^** model makes an attack that targets that unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
