          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Units can disembark from this **^^Transport^^** after it has Advanced. Units that do so count as having made a Normal move that phase, and cannot declare a charge in the same turn, but can otherwise act normally.</characteristic>
