          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit (excluding **^^Monsters^^** and **^^Vehicles^^**) that was hit by one or more attacks made with this model’s Wyvern quad stormshard mortar. Unit the start of your next Shooting phase, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
