        </profile>
        <profile name="Crassus" id="2658-43ff-614e-ec29" hidden="false" typeId="74f8-5443-9d6d-1f1e" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 35 ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY models. Each Heavy Weapons Team model and Veteran Heavy Weapons Team model takes up the space of  2 models. Each OGRYN model takes up the space of 3 models. It cannot transport ARTILLERY models.</characteristic>
