          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 6 Astra Militarum Infantry models. Each Heavy Weapons Team model and Veteran Heavy Weapons Team model takes up the space of 2 models. It cannot transport Ogryn or Artillery models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
