                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Astra Militarum Tech-Priest Enginseer^^** model only. At the start of your Shooting phase, select one **^^Transport^^** from your army (excluding **^^Aircraft^^** and **^^Titanic^^** units) within 3&quot; of the bearer. Until the end of the phase, each time that **^^Transport^^** makes an attack, you can re-roll the Hit roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
