                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit. Each time a model in the bearer&apos;s unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is less than the Toughness characteristic of that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
