              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Astra Militarum Vehicle^^** or **^^Astra Militarum Tech-Priest Enginseer^^** unit only. At the end of the battle, if this unit is part of your Crusade army and was not destroyed during the battle, you can re-roll one failed Out of Action test taken for a friendly **^^Astra Militarum Vehicle^^** unit.</characteristic>
